<title>SINGAPORE: SPC appoints new director.</title>
<headline>SPC appoints new director.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Petroleum Company Ltd (SPC) said on Wednesday it appointed Joan Maria Ting Ping Ee as director with effect from April 30.</p>
<p>Ting, senior vice-president (management) corporate banking/trade services and fund transfer with DBS Bank replaces Chong Kie Cheong, executive vice-president of DBS Bank who resigned from the SPC board on April 10.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3080)</p>
